# Hipparion: "This creature can't block creatures with power 3 or greater unless you pay {1}." Bot2 spent all its mana on
# Hipparion, so on turn 3 it has nothing to pay with. Blocking Alpine Grizzly (power 4) costs {1}, and blocking Kalonian
# Tusker (power 3) costs {1} too (CR 509.1d): neither can be paid, so each declaration is given up and taken back (CR 509.1,
# 733), to be declared again. Blocking Elite Vanguard (power 2) costs nothing and is asked no payment. Bot2 takes the
# Grizzly's 4 and the Tusker's 3; Hipparion takes the Vanguard's 2 and deals it 1.

